  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Indicative visualization, not legally authoritative demarcation or production qualification.",
    "All 514 administrative identities are represented, not a certified gap-free land surface.",
    "Eight named lake/reservoir/forest source features remain explicitly unassigned; no area was guessed or filled.",
    "Geometry has a 2020 vintage. Reconstructed 38-province parents are from the 2025 catalogue; current legal boundary alignment is unverified.",
